{"id":"c9a802fc6a847063","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-nonmonotonic-betting.md","title":"非单调下注策略与Kolmogorov–Loveland随机性","display":"df-nonmonotonic-betting — 非单调下注策略与Kolmogorov–Loveland随机性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-nonmonotonic-betting","aliases":["43-df-nonmonotonic-betting"],"display":"df-nonmonotonic-betting — 非单调下注策略与Kolmogorov–Loveland随机性","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-partial-martingale]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Definitions 12.4.1–12.4.3","source_printed_pages":"334","source_pdf_pages":"354","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-nonmonotonic-betting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-nonmonotonic-betting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nonmonotonic-betting — 非单调下注策略与Kolmogorov–Loveland随机性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df8eac4626d45afe\" href=\"?note=df8eac4626d45afe\" title=\"43-df-partial-martingale\">43-df-partial-martingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definitions 12.4.1–12.4.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"334"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"354"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> 为下式定义的有限赋值序列域；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w^\\frown(r,b)\">\\(w^\\frown(r,b)\\)</span> 表示向序列追加一个位置—比特对，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pos}(w)\">\\(\\operatorname{pos}(w)\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathcal A\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(s:\\mathcal A\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal A\\rightharpoonup[0,2]\">\\(q:\\mathcal A\\rightharpoonup[0,2]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。有限赋值序列使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a> 的产品及有限序列编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"df8eac4626d45afe\" href=\"?note=df8eac4626d45afe\" title=\"43-df-partial-martingale\">43-df-partial-martingale</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{s,q,n}^X\\subseteq\\mathcal A\">\\(P_{s,q,n}^X\\subseteq\\mathcal A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{s,q,n}^X\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(D_{s,q,n}^X\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span> 为下式递归确定的空集或单点集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A:=\\{w\\in(\\mathbb N\\times\\{0,1\\})^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|w|\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall b,c&lt;2\\;\\neg(w(i)=(r,b)\\land w(j)=(r,c))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A:=\\{w\\in(\\mathbb N\\times\\{0,1\\})^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall i&lt;j&lt;|w|\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall b,c&lt;2\\;\\neg(w(i)=(r,b)\\land w(j)=(r,c))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\#_{\\mathcal A}:=\\operatorname{ResCode}_{(\\mathbb N\\times\\{0,1\\})^{&lt;\\omega}}(\\mathcal A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\#_{\\mathcal A}:=\\operatorname{ResCode}_{(\\mathbb N\\times\\{0,1\\})^{&lt;\\omega}}(\\mathcal A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pos}(w):=\\{r\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists i&lt;|w|\\;\\exists b&lt;2\\;w(i)=(r,b)\\},\\qquad w^\\frown(r,b):=w\\cup\\{(|w|,(r,b))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pos}(w):=\\{r\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists i&lt;|w|\\;\\exists b&lt;2\\;w(i)=(r,b)\\},\\qquad w^\\frown(r,b):=w\\cup\\{(|w|,(r,b))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NMBetting}(s,q)\\iff\\operatorname{dom}(s)=\\operatorname{dom}(q)\\land\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;s(w)\\notin\\operatorname{pos}(w).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NMBetting}(s,q)\\iff\\operatorname{dom}(s)=\\operatorname{dom}(q)\\land\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;s(w)\\notin\\operatorname{pos}(w).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ComputableNMBetting}(s,q)\\iff\\operatorname{NMBetting}(s,q)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(s)\\land\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_{\\mathcal A}(q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ComputableNMBetting}(s,q)\\iff\\operatorname{NMBetting}(s,q)\\land\\operatorname{Computable}(s)\\land\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}_{\\mathcal A}(q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_{s,q,0}^X:=\\{\\varepsilon\\},\\qquad D_{s,q,0}^X:=\\{1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_{s,q,0}^X:=\\{\\varepsilon\\},\\qquad D_{s,q,0}^X:=\\{1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_{s,q,n+1}^X:=\\{w^\\frown(r,X(r)):w\\in P_{s,q,n}^X,\\ (w,r)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(s),\\ r\\notin\\operatorname{pos}(w)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_{s,q,n+1}^X:=\\{w^\\frown(r,X(r)):w\\in P_{s,q,n}^X,\\ (w,r)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(s),\\ r\\notin\\operatorname{pos}(w)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{s,q,n+1}^X:=\\{v(a(1-X(r))+(2-a)X(r)):v\\in D_{s,q,n}^X,\\ w\\in P_{s,q,n}^X,\\ (w,r)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(s),\\ (w,a)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(q),\\ r\\notin\\operatorname{pos}(w)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{s,q,n+1}^X:=\\{v(a(1-X(r))+(2-a)X(r)):v\\in D_{s,q,n}^X,\\ w\\in P_{s,q,n}^X,\\ (w,r)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(s),\\ (w,a)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(q),\\ r\\notin\\operatorname{pos}(w)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{graph}(p_{s,q}^X):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\{n\\}\\times P_{s,q,n}^X),\\qquad\\operatorname{graph}(d_{s,q}^X):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\{n\\}\\times D_{s,q,n}^X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{graph}(p_{s,q}^X):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\{n\\}\\times P_{s,q,n}^X),\\qquad\\operatorname{graph}(d_{s,q}^X):=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\{n\\}\\times D_{s,q,n}^X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NMSucceeds}(s,q,X)\\iff\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists v\\in D_{s,q,n}^X\\;v&gt;b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NMSucceeds}(s,q,X)\\iff\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists v\\in D_{s,q,n}^X\\;v&gt;b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KLRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall s,q\\;(\\operatorname{ComputableNMBetting}(s,q)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{NMSucceeds}(s,q,X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{KLRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall s,q\\;(\\operatorname{ComputableNMBetting}(s,q)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{NMSucceeds}(s,q,X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每层运行和资本至多有一个值，后继集合由前层实际值和s、q的图构造；停止后对应集合为空。新位置必须尚未读取。0结果的资本倍数a和1结果倍数2−a平均为1，非负性来自a∈[0,2]。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：Definitions 12.4.1–12.4.3。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-partial-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"df8eac4626d45afe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-partial-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal A$ 为下式定义的有限赋值序列域；$w^\\frown(r,b)$ 表示向序列追加一个位置—比特对，$\\operatorname{pos}(w)$ 由下式定义。$s:\\mathcal A\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$、$q:\\mathcal A\\rightharpoonup[0,2]$，$X\\in2^\\omega$。有限赋值序列使用 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 的产品及有限序列编码；$\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-partial-martingale]]。$P_{s,q,n}^X\\subseteq\\mathcal A$、$D_{s,q,n}^X\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 为下式递归确定的空集或单点集。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-partial-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"df8eac4626d45afe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal A$ 为下式定义的有限赋值序列域；$w^\\frown(r,b)$ 表示向序列追加一个位置—比特对，$\\operatorname{pos}(w)$ 由下式定义。$s:\\mathcal A\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$、$q:\\mathcal A\\rightharpoonup[0,2]$，$X\\in2^\\omega$。有限赋值序列使用 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 的产品及有限序列编码；$\\operatorname{PartialComputableReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-partial-martingale]]。$P_{s,q,n}^X\\subseteq\\mathcal A$、$D_{s,q,n}^X\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$ 为下式递归确定的空集或单点集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"w^\\frown(r,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pos}(w)","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\mathcal A\\rightharpoonup\\math